# Mandatory New-Chat Startup Read

At the start of every new chat in this repository, read these sources in full
before searching code, editing files, running validation, creating commits, or
calling GitHub:

1. `CLAUDE.md`
2. `docs/AGENT_WORKFLOW.md`
3. Every `.cursor/rules/*.mdc` rule file
4. Any applicable `AGENTS.md` found from the repository root to the target
   directory

Do not treat prior chat memory, a short request, or an apparently routine task
as permission to skip this read. Follow the resulting workflow in order,
including pull-before-change, release notes, push, queue status, and
`validation` labels for work awaiting on-device confirmation.
